  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EEM Mexico 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The European Union intends to send an Electoral Expert Mission (EEM) to Mexico to collect factual information concerning the electoral process (general elections are scheduled for 02/06/2024). IOM will select 4 Experts (One Team Leader/Political Expert, one Electoral/Campaign Finance Expert, one Legal/Human Rights Expert, one Media/Social Media Expert), who will travel to Mexico in May/June to meet all relevant stakeholders and produce a report. IOM will have no visibility and will not be associated in any way to the work of the experts; we will provide administrative, logistical and security support.</narrative>
  </description>
